# No client-side env vars are required to run Dugout locally.
#
# If you later add a server-side process (e.g. an Express proxy that calls
# an LLM provider), declare its secrets here so deployments know what to
# inject -- but never reference them from `src/` and never wire them
# through Vite's `define`, which would inline the literal value into the
# client bundle.
#
# Example (server-only, do not consume from src/):
# GEMINI_API_KEY="your-key-here"

# DISABLE_HMR: optional dev-server flag. AI Studio sets this to "true" to
# avoid file-watch flicker during agent edits.
DISABLE_HMR=""
